  ------------------------
    WAVEFUNCTION SUMMARY
  ------------------------

  MO formalism                     : Restricted
  Calculation type                 : Hartree-Fock
  Number of atoms                  : 6
  Number of basis functions        : 48
  Primitive gaussians              : 94
  Spin density (FChk)              : not found, reconstructed from MOs
  Occupied MOs (nocc/alpha/beta)   : 10 / 10 / 10
  SCF/DFT energy (au)              :      -152.0623683354

  -----------------
    INPUT SUMMARY
  -----------------

  # METHOD
  --------
  Atomic partitioning (real-space)     : TFVC (Topological Fuzzy Voronoi Cells)
  Oxidation states analysis            : OSLO (oxidation states localized orbitals)
  Energy decomposition                 : ENPART (one- and two-center IQA terms, see below)
  Fragment analysis                    : 2 fragments (see below)

  # ENPART
  --------
  Functional              : HF
  Atom-pair skip threshold: THREBOD = 10
  Two-electron grid       : 40 x 146 (# GRID)
  Rotation angles (2E)    : 0.162 / 0.182 (calibrated)

  # OSLO
  ------
  Overlap matrix          : TFVC/real-space (default)
  FOLI tolerance          : 3
  Branching               : none
  Print non-orthogonalized: no

  # FRAGMENTS  (2 fragments)
  --------------------------
  Fragment  1 :   1   2   3
  Fragment  2 :   4   5   6

